{"license":"CC0-1.0","fileAccessRequest":true,"metadataBlocks":{"citation":{"displayName":"Citation Metadata","name":"citation","fields":[{"typeName":"title","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"Lesbische, homoseksuele, biseksuele jongeren - LHBJ2013"},{"typeName":"otherId","multiple":true,"typeClass":"compound","value":[{"otherIdAgency":{"typeName":"otherIdAgency","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"DANS-KNAW"},"otherIdValue":{"typeName":"otherIdValue","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"easy-dataset:127610"}}]},{"typeName":"author","multiple":true,"typeClass":"compound","value":[{"authorName":{"typeName":"authorName","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"Sociaal en Cultureel Planbureau (SCP)"}}]},{"typeName":"datasetContact","multiple":true,"typeClass":"compound","value":[{"datasetContactName":{"typeName":"datasetContactName","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"SCP  Databeheerder"},"datasetContactAffiliation":{"typeName":"datasetContactAffiliation","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"Sociaal en Cultureel Planbureau"}}]},{"typeName":"dsDescription","multiple":true,"typeClass":"compound","value":[{"dsDescriptionValue":{"typeName":"dsDescriptionValue","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"<p>In het kader van het onderzoek naar de acceptatie van homoseksualiteit in Nederland is informatie verzameld over lesbische, homoseksuele en biseksuele (LHB) jongeren van 16 t\/m 25 jaar. Gevraagd is naar hun ervaringen met hun seksuele voorkeur, coming-out, acceptatie en homo-negativiteit in hun omgeving, gezondheid en welbevinden. Voor controlegroepen, heteroseksuele jongeren en bijna-heteroseksuele jongeren, is informatie verzameld over hun sociaal-demografische achtergrond, welzijn en gezondheid.<br>Het onderzoek is uitgevoerd in opdracht van de Directie Emancipatie van het ministerie van Onderwijs, Cultuur en Wetenschap.<\/p>"}}]},{"typeName":"subject","multiple":true,"typeClass":"controlledVocabulary","value":["Social Sciences"]},{"typeName":"keyword","multiple":true,"typeClass":"compound","value":[{"keywordValue":{"typeName":"keywordValue","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"Homoseksualiteit"}},{"keywordValue":{"typeName":"keywordValue","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"Lesbisch"}},{"keywordValue":{"typeName":"keywordValue","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"Homoseksueel"}},{"keywordValue":{"typeName":"keywordValue","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"Biseksueel"}},{"keywordValue":{"typeName":"keywordValue","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"Transgender"}},{"keywordValue":{"typeName":"keywordValue","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"Homo"}},{"keywordValue":{"typeName":"keywordValue","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"Coming-Out"}},{"keywordValue":{"typeName":"keywordValue","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"Acceptatie"}},{"keywordValue":{"typeName":"keywordValue","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"Homo-negativiteit"}},{"keywordValue":{"typeName":"keywordValue","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"Seksuele Voorkeur"}},{"keywordValue":{"typeName":"keywordValue","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"Discriminatie"}},{"keywordValue":{"typeName":"keywordValue","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"Homo-Emancipatie"}},{"keywordValue":{"typeName":"keywordValue","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"Seksuele Minderheden"}}]},{"typeName":"language","multiple":true,"typeClass":"controlledVocabulary","value":["Dutch"]},{"typeName":"productionDate","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"2013-12-01"},{"typeName":"distributionDate","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"2019-05-23"},{"typeName":"dateOfDeposit","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"2019-05-23"}]},"dansRights":{"displayName":"Rights Metadata","name":"dansRights","fields":[{"typeN